        "doc": "\nDocument: https://uniapp.dcloud.net.cn/worktile/auto/hbuilderx-cli-uniapp-test.html\nUsages:\n  cli uniapp.test web --project <ProjectPath> --browser chrome \n  cli uniapp.test web-chrome --project <ProjectPath>\n  cli uniapp.test web-safari --project <ProjectPath>\n  cli uniapp.test web-firefox --project <ProjectPath>\n  cli uniapp.test mp-weixin --project <ProjectPath>\n  cli uniapp.test mp-alipay --project <ProjectPath>\n  cli uniapp.test app-android --project <ProjectPath> \n  cli uniapp.test app-ios-simulator --project <ProjectPath> \n  cli uniapp.test app-ios --project <ProjectPath> --peveloperCertificate <p12Path> --provisioningProfile <mobileprovisionPath> --privateKeyPassword <password> \n  # 指定测试设备、指定测试用例文件  \n  cli uniapp.test app-harmony --project <ProjectPath> --testcaseFile <testcase_file_path> --device_id <id> \n  # 以蒸汽模式运行、指定视图层编译目标 \n  cli uniapp.test app-android --project <ProjectPath> --vapor true --vapor_render_target nativecode",
